qtpy-mcp
========

This project began as a fork of qt-mcp by the qt-mcp contributors
(https://github.com/0xCarbon/qt-mcp), imported at commit
24303a69d498417dfcec0223bfaa95964f788c17 and used under the terms of its
"MIT OR Apache-2.0" licence. See LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE.

Changes from upstream include: Qt.py instead of a hand-rolled binding shim (adding
PySide2/PyQt5 support), Python 3.10+, fuzzy semantic widget search, GIF recording,
strict typing, and a tag-driven PyPI release pipeline.
